<title>USA: Atrix Int'l enters distribution pact.</title>
<headline>Atrix Int'l enters distribution pact.</headline>
<dateline>BURNSVILLE, Minn. 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Atrix International Inc said Wednesday it entered a one-year distribution agreement with IPCO Safety of Bristol Pa.</p>
<p>Under the agreement, IPCO Safety will have non-exclusive rights to distribute the new Atrix Omega series vacuum and filter products for the asbestos abatement industry.</p>
<p>Atrix manufactures remote metering and copy control products.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
